Do NOT:

* Rewrite working modules
* Create duplicate services
* Create duplicate authentication
* Create duplicate RBAC
* Create duplicate tenant handling
* Create duplicate notification infrastructure
* Create duplicate file storage
* Replace existing architecture without strong justification

Reuse existing systems wherever possible.

