# 17. CANDIDATE SCORING

Create configurable candidate scoring.

Example:

```text
Skill Match          40%
Experience           20%
Education            10%
Salary Compatibility 10%
Notice Period        10%
Location             10%
```

Final score:

```text
Candidate Score = Weighted Criteria Score
```

Make criteria configurable.

Do not make hiring decisions automatically based solely on AI.

