# 137. MOST IMPORTANT RULE

## INSPECT FIRST → UNDERSTAND SECOND → DESIGN THIRD → IMPLEMENT FOURTH → TEST FIFTH → SECURE SIXTH → DOCUMENT LAST

Do not blindly generate files.

Do not assume the repository structure.

Do not recreate existing services.

Do not duplicate database entities.

Do not bypass tenant isolation.

Do not bypass RBAC.

Do not allow AI to bypass authorization.

Do not allow LLMs unrestricted database access.

Do not make automated employment decisions.

Do not expose candidate or employee confidential information.

Do not break Phase 1–9.

The final result must make AxonTimeHR a **scalable, secure, enterprise-grade HR platform with recruitment, workforce planning, advanced analytics, and a controlled AI intelligence layer**, while preserving all existing functionality.

# END OF AXONTIMEHR PHASE 10 DEVELOPMENT PROMPT

**Recommended architecture after Phase 10:** keep the next phases focused rather than continuing to add unrelated HR modules. A strong roadmap would be **Phase 11 — Employee Self-Service + Mobile/PWA + Advanced Communication**, followed by **Phase 12 — Compliance, Statutory HR & Enterprise Governance**, and then **Phase 13 — SaaS Administration, Billing, Plans, Usage Metering & Multi-Organization Enterprise Features**.
